title: Skills × Paradigm Convergence — Foundational Assessment
summary: 'Explored the philosophical intersection of Claude Code skills and Paradigm''s structured context system. Identified three convergence patterns: protocol-to-skill bridge (protocols auto-generate skills), aspect-enforcing skills (cross-cutting rules become proactive guides), and flow-guided skills (.purpose flows derive their own instruction sets). Core thesis: skills today are authored artifacts, Paradigm metadata is emergent structure — the future is skills that derive themselves from project structure and evolve as the codebase changes.'
