decisions:
  - id: skills-paradigm-convergence
    decision: Paradigm should explore becoming a skill discovery and derivation engine, not just a context provider
    rationale: Skills are the activation mechanism, Paradigm is the knowledge graph. Connecting them means Claude loads the right behavior for the right context automatically, without monolithic CLAUDE.md.
tags:
